  "details": "When you want to take a screenshot in-game using the SteamVR screenshot button combination, your character instantly enters the new AFK pose for a split second. This means all screenshots of yourself are now unusable since the introduction of Avatars 3.0 and it's also super annoying and looks weird to quickly go in and out of that pose each time you take a screenshot.\nTo solve this, the AFK pose should be delayed by e.g. a second so that it's not instantly played (and in case of a screenshot never)",
